cff-version: 1.2.0
message: 'If you use this template, please cite it as below.'
title: 'template-nextjs: an opinionated, production-ready Next.js starter template'
abstract: >-
  An opinionated, production-ready Next.js template for building sites, blogs and
  landing pages. Ships with the App Router and React Server Components, TypeScript in
  strict mode, a Tailwind CSS design system with dark mode, SEO and security header
  defaults, a unit test suite with a 100% coverage floor, Playwright end-to-end tests,
  Docker images, a Makefile front door, GitHub Actions CI/CD and a MkDocs Material
  documentation site.
